  mmap_grant_refusable flags model nZ = false.
Proof.
  intros flags model a nZ hint HnZ Hg Hbk.
  destruct (grant_ok_na_unpack _ _ _ _ Hg) as (Gal & Gpos & Gce & Gfree & _).
